<title>NETHERLANDS: EU's de Silguy sees pact deal Sunday or Monday.</title>
<headline>EU's de Silguy sees pact deal Sunday or Monday.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Monetary Affairs Commissioner Yves Thibault de Silguy said on Sunday that he believed there would be an agreement on an EU stability pact either on Sunday or Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a will to succeed. Either tonight or tomorrow there will be a solution,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
